{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01086","headline":"相和歌辞 王昭君 · 董思恭","name":"相和歌辞 王昭君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琵琶马上弹，行路曲中难。\n汉月正南远，燕山直北寒。\n髻鬟风拂散，眉黛雪沾残。\n斟酌红颜尽，何劳镜里看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"董思恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}